      "ArticleTitle": "[Effects of monotherapy with an alpha1-adrenoblocker doxazosin and its combination with beta1-adrenoblocker atenolol on hemodynamics, reversible myocardial ischemia in postmyocardial infarction patients with arterial hypertension].",
